      "hizbQuarter": 126,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2414,
      "text": "He said, “No; you throw first.” Suddenly their ropes and staffs appeared to him, owing to their magic, as if they were slithering.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 66,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 316,
      "ruku": 272,
      "hizbQuarter": 126,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2415,
      "text": "Then Moses sensed fear within himself.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 67,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 316,
      "ruku": 272,
      "hizbQuarter": 126,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2416,
      "text": "We said, “Do not be afraid; it is you who will prevail.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 68,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 316,
      "ruku": 272,
      "hizbQuarter": 126,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2417,
      "text": "Throw what is in your right hand; it will swallow up what they have contrived. They have only contrived a magic trick, and the magician will never prosper, wherever he goes.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 69,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 316,
      "ruku": 272,
      "hizbQuarter": 126,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2418,
      "text": "So the magicians fell down in prostration[17], saying, “We believe in the Lord of Aaron and Moses.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 70,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 316,
      "ruku": 272,
      "hizbQuarter": 126,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2419,
      "text": "Pharaoh said, “How dare you believe in him before I give you permission! He must be your master who taught you magic! I will surely cut off your hands and feet on opposite sides, and I will crucify you on the trunks of palm trees; you will surely know whose punishment is more severe and more lasting!”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 71,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 316,
      "ruku": 272,
      "hizbQuarter": 126,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2420,
      "text": "They said, “We will never prefer you over the clear signs that have come to us, or over the One Who created us[18]. So decide whatever you will. You can only make a decision about the life of this world.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 72,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 316,
      "ruku": 272,
      "hizbQuarter": 126,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2421,
      "text": "We surely believe in our Lord so that He may forgive us our sins and the magic that you have compelled us to practice, for Allah is best [in reward] and more lasting [in punishment].”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 73,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 316,
      "ruku": 272,
      "hizbQuarter": 126,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2422,
      "text": "Whoever comes to his Lord as an evildoer, for him is Hell; he will neither die therein nor live[19].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 74,
      "juz": 16,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 316,
      "ruku": 272,
      "hizbQuarter": 126,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2423,
      "text": "But whoever comes to Him as a believer, having done righteous deeds, it is they who will have the highest ranks:",
      "surah": {
        "number": 20,
        "name": "سُورَةُ طه",
        "englishName": "Taa-Haa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Taa-Haa",
        "numberOfAyahs": 135,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 75,
      "juz": 16,
